1
00:00:16,180 --> 00:00:19,500
Arashi o saite moeagare!
Tear through the storm and blaze!

2
00:00:19,500 --> 00:00:24,500
Kagayake HERO!
Shine, hero!

3
00:00:26,340 --> 00:00:32,400
Bakuon todorokase teki ga kuru
The enemy comes with a thunderous roar!

4
00:00:33,660 --> 00:00:39,420
Ankoku boufuu no yoru ni saseru na!
Don't let a night of dark storms fall!

5
00:00:39,420 --> 00:00:42,920
Seigi no kokoro shiru mono yo
You who know the heart of justice...

6
00:00:42,920 --> 00:00:45,500
Hikari ni naru nda!
become the light!

7
00:00:46,920 --> 00:00:50,940
Sono mune ni atsuku moeru
Burning fiercely in your heart...

8
00:00:50,940 --> 00:00:54,160
Yuuki to ai o hanate!
unleash your courage and love!

9
00:00:54,160 --> 00:00:57,400
Saa ima ga sono toki da!
Now is the time!

10
00:00:57,400 --> 00:01:00,400
Let's set fire on!

11
00:01:00,460 --> 00:01:03,280
Inochi o kakete!
Put your life on the line!

12
00:01:03,280 --> 00:01:07,000
Hashire THUNDER! Never surrender!
Run, Thunder! Never surrender!

13
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:12,300
Arashi o saite moeagaru
Tear through the storm and blaze!

14
00:01:12,300 --> 00:01:15,300
Kimi koso senshi da!
You are the warrior!

15
00:01:24,740 --> 00:01:28,600
Itsumademo wasurenai sa
I'll never forget...

16
00:01:28,600 --> 00:01:31,860
Senaka ni tagiru toushi
the fighting spirit surging through me.

17
00:01:31,860 --> 00:01:35,400
Mou ashita o hanasanai
I won't let tomorrow slip away again.

18
00:01:35,400 --> 00:01:38,180
We get rainbow!

19
00:01:38,180 --> 00:01:41,260
Arashi o saite
Tear through the storm!

20
00:01:41,260 --> 00:01:43,500
Hashire THUNDER!
Race on, Thunder!

21
00:01:43,500 --> 00:01:45,340
You're a challenger!

22
00:01:45,340 --> 00:01:50,100
Arashi no naka de tachiagaru
Rising up amid the storm...

23
00:01:50,100 --> 00:01:53,100
Kimi koso senshi da!
you are the warrior!
